<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia sets internal coffee price at new high.</title>
<headline>Colombia sets internal coffee price at new high.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia raised its internal coffee price by 5.48 percent Friday to a new record-high of 327,250 pesos per 125-kg load.</p>
<p>The increase, announced in a statement from the National Coffee Growers' Federation, was the fourth since Jan. 31 when the internal price was set at 248,125 pesos per 125-kg load.</p>
<p>The new price, which should hold at least through next Friday, works out to 2,618 pesos per kilo.</p>
<p>((-- Juan Guillermo Londono, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
